{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週放送の\n最終回の乃木どこ？を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、、、なんと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後と能條でやります！ぜひみてね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、川後です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in京都"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops:evelyn\nskirt:WEGO\nshoes:NIKE\nhair:ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むっちゃ目立つ、\nブルーのスニーカー！\nかっこいいーっていっぱい言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部:"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tops: ？\nskirt:evelyn\nhair:創作"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアはメイクさんに\nおまかせでつくってもらった♡\n可愛くってお気に入り！！\nリボンはヘアゴムだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日連続握手だから\n\"今日もきたよー\"とか\"昨日ぶりー\"が\n多かったかな(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのひとにも\n会えてよかったなあ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての人には、\n川後チョップすることが多いんだけど\nよくびっくりされるっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、その反応が面白いからやる(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなはもう川後チョップくらった？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月9日発売\n週刊ヤングジャンプ（アンダーメンバー）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月10日発売MARQUEEの連載ページ(川後×井上）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また改めて書く予定だけど、告知！\nチェックよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(今度パンケーキおごってあげるんだ笑笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(2人合わさるとソースみたい。笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/04/07/3552127/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ☁︎☁︎☁︎"}],"source":"archive"}